# Security headers for Cloudflare Pages (website-plan.md §11).
  #
  # NOTE: no leading `/*` block here. It used to open the file, contain only
  # comments, and declare no headers — Cloudflare rejected it (wrangler:
  # "Found 1 invalid header rule ... No headers specified") while still parsing
  # the real rules below it. The global headers live on the final `/*` rule.
  #
  # CSP notes:
  # - 'unsafe-inline' for script-src is required by the two tiny inline
  #   scripts in the layouts (theme pre-paint, root locale redirect).
  #   Hardening path: move them to external hashed files, then drop
  #   'unsafe-inline'. Do NOT remove it now — the theme toggle and the
  #   root "/" redirect will stop working.
  # - style-src covers the Paddle.js overlay stylesheet (injected into the
  #   page from cdn.paddle.com / sandbox-cdn.paddle.com).
  # - frame-src/connect-src cover the Paddle.js checkout overlay and the
  #   license-server web API (OTP auth, contact form, account page). The
  #   API host is resolved at RUNTIME via worker.ts [vars] LICENSE_API_URL
  #   (runbook §8); connect-src allows any *.code.run host so a Northflank
  #   URL change needs no rebuild.
  # - fonts.googleapis.com (style-src) + fonts.gstatic.com (font-src) cover
  #   the Google Fonts <link> tags in website/public/admin/*.html — standalone
  #   pages with their own CDN stylesheet. The public site does NOT use them:
  #   Base.astro self-hosts Inter/JetBrains Mono via fontsource (global.css),
  #   so its faces are fetched from 'self' only.
  # - static.cloudflareinsights.com (script-src) covers the Cloudflare Web
  #   Analytics beacon auto-injected on the account/dashboard pages.
  #
  # ── Caching (Lighthouse "use efficient cache lifetimes") ─────────
  # /_astro/* filenames are content-hashed by Astro's build (e.g.
  # client.D9VvwaQT.js) — safe to cache for a year, immutable. Everything
  # else static (logos, og-image, favicon) is NOT fingerprinted: 7 days is
  # a safe upper bound for repeat-visit benefit while keeping redeploys
  # fresh without manual busting. HTML must never be cached: deploys must
  # be visible immediately and the /en/account page is session-gated.
  /_astro/*
    Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  /videos/*
    Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  /admin/*
    Cache-Control: no-store, max-age=0
    X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  # Internal design-language + KDS prototype pages. These ARE deliberately
  # published (scripts/sync-dev-files.mjs copies repo-root prototypes/ into
  # public/dev/ at prebuild, so they are served at kasir.mu/dev/) — but they
  # are internal references, not acquisition pages. noindex keeps direct links
  # working while keeping them out of search results. Do NOT "fix" this with a
  # robots.txt Disallow: that would hide the tag and defeat the de-index.
  # See docs/records/seo-robots-llms-review-19-09-26.md §1.3 R1.
  /dev/*
    X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  # llms.txt is a machine-facing summary of the whole site, consumed by
  # fetching it directly — indexing it adds nothing to search and would put a
  # text/plain duplicate of the real pages in the results. Google's own
  # guidance (J. Mueller, Jan 2026) is to keep the file if you want but
  # noindex it. X-Robots-Tag is the ONLY correct mechanism here: a robots.txt
  # Disallow would stop the crawler from ever seeing this header and would
  # therefore defeat the de-index. See
  # docs/records/seo-robots-llms-review-19-09-26.md §2.2 L8.
  /llms.txt
    X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  /og-image.png
    Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
  /favicon.svg
    Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
  /*
    Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.paddle.com https://sandbox-cdn.paddle.com https://app.midtrans.com https://app.sandbox.midtrans.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://*.paddle.com https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: https://*.paddle.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; frame-src https://*.paddle.com https://app.midtrans.com https://app.sandbox.midtrans.com; connect-src 'self' https://*.code.run https://*.paddle.com https://*.kasir.mu https://app.midtrans.com https://app.sandbox.midtrans.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
